<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Living for Jesus who died in my place,</l><l>Bearing on Calv’ry my sin and disgrace;</l><l>Such love constrains me to answer His call,</l><l>Follow His leading and give Him my all.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Living for Jesus wherever I am,</l><l>Doing each duty in His holy name;</l><l>Willing to suffer affliction and loss,</l><l>Deeming each trial a part of my cross.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Living for Jesus through earth’s little while,</l><l>My dearest treasure, the light of His smile;</l><l>Seeking the lost ones He died to redeem,</l><l>Bringing the weary to find rest in Him.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
